## Artwork overview

* ### Medium

  oil on canvas
* ### Credit Line

  [Corcoran Collection (Museum Purchase, Gallery Fund)](/artwork-search?keywords=Credit%20Line%3A%20%22Corcoran%20Collection%20%28Museum%20Purchase%2C%20Gallery%20Fund%29%22)
* ### Dimensions

